Portions ported from other projects
-----------------------------------

No source code from OsmAnd, Navi, Organic Maps, or any other navigation
project has been ported into Kvali at this time. Organic Maps was consulted
for interaction design only; no code or assets were copied.

If GPL-licensed code is ported in the future, every ported file will keep its
original copyright notice and the upstream commit SHA will be recorded here.

